      "id": 487166,
      "username": "jewel71",
      "name": "jewel rana",
      "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:22:14.956Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have a custom Doctype called <strong>Student</strong>, and one of its fields is <strong>department</strong>.<br>\nI want the List View of this Doctype to be <strong>grouped by department</strong>, so that all records under the same department appear together.</p>\n<p>I’ve checked List View settings and custom scripts, but I’m not sure what is the correct way to implement grouping in the List View of a custom Doctype.</p>\n<p>I want something like below Picture.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/a/fa8d1ba581613188963fdf2799941437e30533af.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fa8d1ba581613188963fdf2799941437e30533af\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/a/fa8d1ba581613188963fdf2799941437e30533af.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zKtGMJ4mPAh4C8mtTeJOIkGqFvV\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\" data-dominant-color=\"F8FAFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1200×630 18.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/a/fa8d1ba581613188963fdf2799941437e30533af.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/fa8d1ba581613188963fdf2799941437e30533af\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/a/fa8d1ba581613188963fdf2799941437e30533af.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zKtGMJ4mPAh4C8mtTeJOIkGqFvV\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\" data-dominant-color=\"F8FAFB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\