      "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:06:03.431Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/jewel71\">@jewel71</a></p>\n<p>It looks like you want a report right within list view of your custom doctype.</p>\n<p>Better to have a query report and group data by any criteria will surely serve the purpose.</p>",
